    answer: "Show what a player does with the cards, provide readable examples and state exactly what each reward contains. For a fixed-deck game, show the deck contents. For a TCG, explain starter products, pack contents and any confirmed randomness clearly. Do not ask backers to infer the product from a large spread of card artwork.",
    relatedSlugs: ["board-game-kickstarter-gameplay-rulebook", "kickstarter-reward-tier-graphics", "kickstarter-prototype-risks-disclosure"],
